  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Plankpad is the founder of the first app connected Plank- and Balance Board.<br>&nbsp;<br>The Plankpad PRO is an innovative fitness device that perfectly combines training and entertainment. As an interactive balance and plank board with app connection, it turns your workout into an exciting sport and gaming experience.<br><br>The high-quality construction made of maple wood with walnut elements and a soft surface offers optimum training comfort. The free app gives you access to various games, workouts and challenges that can also be streamed to your smart TV - ideal for training with the whole family.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The dynamic training activates the entire body muscles, especially the core area: arms, shoulders, back, abdomen, glutes and legs are trained simultaneously and efficiently.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The playful elements ensure a high level of motivation and make training time fly by. Controlling the games using body movements makes the training even more intense than with classic planking. With just a few minutes of training a day, you can improve your fitness and optimize your posture.</p></div>",
